      "headingRaw": "Seven-character-regular-verseDuFuPOETICTHOUGHTSONANCIENTSITESI",
      "translationRaw": "Forlorninthenortheastamongwindanddust，Driftinginthesouthwestbetweenheavenandearth，LingeringfordaysandmonthsintowersandterracesattheThreeGorges，SharingcloudsandmountainswiththecostumesoftheFiveStreams。Thebarbarianservingtherulerintheendwasunreliable。Thewanderingpoetlamentingthetimeshadnochancetoreturn。YuXinthroughouthislifewasmostmiserable，Inhiswaningyearshispoetrystirredthelandofriversandpasses。",
